            ORG PRFBS
FTADIMG EQU $990F ; captured descriptor image-base field
FTCTX00 EQU $991C ; captured context runtime-base field
FTCTX06 EQU $9922 ; captured context state-base field
FTCTX0E EQU $992A ; captured context read-only-data-base field
FTMAP01 EQU $9949 ; captured target map entry-address field
FTMAP03 EQU $994B ; captured target map used length
