FTMPVEC EQU $995B ; captured vector-length map field
FTMPINI EQU $995F ; captured initialized-length map field
FTMPBSS EQU $9961 ; captured BSS-base map field
FTMPSTK EQU $9965 ; captured stack-requirement map field
FTMPDLA EQU $9968 ; captured data-load-address map field
FTMPAGG EQU $996C ; captured aggregate-base map field
FTIXBKC EQU TRGTDSC5 ; target descriptor bank-count field offset

;@ROUTINE OUT CARRY,ZERO CLOBBERS SIGN,PARITY,HALFCARRY,A,BC,DE,HL,IX,IY
PRFSTRT: ;@NUC-GLOBAL ProofStart PERMANENT PRFSTRT
